    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c2_complex_decision_matrix_criterion",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-complex-decision-matrix-01",
        "text": {
          "en": "We should agree on the criteria before scoring options; otherwise the preferred option can quietly determine the criteria afterward."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "قبل از امتیاز دادن به گزینه‌ها باید روی معیارها توافق کنیم؛ وگرنه گزینه موردعلاقه می‌تونه بعداً بی‌صدا معیارها رو تعیین کنه."
        },
        "intent": "set_decision_criteria",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c2_complex_decision_matrix_criterion",
          "c2_complex_decision_matrix_weighting"
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "questions",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c2_complex_decision_matrix_weight",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-complex-decision-matrix-01",
        "text": {
          "en": "The disagreement is not about the scores but the weighting: one team prioritizes speed while another prioritizes reversibility."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "اختلاف درباره امتیازها نیست، درباره وزن‌دهیه: یک تیم سرعت رو مهم‌تر می‌دونه و تیم دیگه برگشت‌پذیری رو."
        },
        "intent": "surface_weighting_disagreement",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c2_complex_decision_matrix_weighting",
          "c2_complex_decision_matrix_reversibility"
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "questions",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c2_complex_decision_matrix_sensitivity",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-complex-decision-matrix-02",
        "text": {
          "en": "A sensitivity check shows the recommendation changes only if cost is weighted almost twice as heavily as reliability."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "بررسی حساسیت نشون می‌ده توصیه فقط وقتی عوض می‌شه که هزینه تقریباً دو برابر قابلیت اعتماد وزن بگیره."
        },
        "intent": "run_sensitivity_reasoning",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c2_complex_decision_matrix_sensitivity",
          "c2_complex_decision_matrix_weighting"
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "questions",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c2_complex_decision_matrix_scenario",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-complex-decision-matrix-02",
        "text": {
          "en": "Option A dominates in the base case, but option B is more robust across the two adverse scenarios."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "گزینه A در سناریوی پایه برتره، ولی گزینه B در دو سناریوی نامطلوب مقاوم‌تره."
        },
        "intent": "compare_scenarios",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c2_complex_decision_matrix_scenario",
          "c2_complex_decision_matrix_robust",
          "c2_complex_decision_matrix_dominate"
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "questions",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c2_complex_decision_matrix_threshold",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-complex-decision-matrix-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "I would set a threshold: if implementation time exceeds six months, the value of option C falls sharply."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "یک آستانه می‌ذارم: اگر زمان اجرا از شش ماه بیشتر بشه ارزش گزینه C شدیداً افت می‌کنه."
        },
        "intent": "define_decision_threshold",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c2_complex_decision_matrix_threshold",
          "c2_complex_decision_matrix_criterion"
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "questions",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c2_complex_decision_matrix_reverse",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-complex-decision-matrix-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "Reversibility deserves extra weight under uncertainty because a correctable mistake is not equivalent to an irreversible one."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "در عدم قطعیت، برگشت‌پذیری باید وزن بیشتری بگیره چون اشتباه قابل اصلاح با اشتباه برگشت‌ناپذیر یکی نیست."
        },
        "intent": "value_reversibility",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c2_complex_decision_matrix_reversibility",
          "c2_complex_decision_matrix_robust"
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "questions",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c2_complex_decision_matrix_dominance",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-complex-decision-matrix-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "No option dominates on every criterion, so the final choice necessarily reflects a judgment about trade-offs rather than pure calculation."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "هیچ گزینه‌ای روی همه معیارها برتر نیست، پس انتخاب نهایی ناچار شامل قضاوت درباره مصالحه‌هاست نه فقط محاسبه."
        },
        "intent": "recognize_non_dominance",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c2_complex_decision_matrix_dominate",
          "c2_complex_decision_matrix_criterion"
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "questions",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c2_complex_decision_matrix_summary",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-complex-decision-matrix-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "A robust decision process makes criteria, weighting, thresholds, scenarios and reversibility explicit enough that reasonable disagreement can be located precisely."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "فرایند تصمیم مقاوم معیارها، وزن‌دهی، آستانه‌ها، سناریوها و برگشت‌پذیری رو اون‌قدر روشن می‌کنه که محل دقیق اختلاف منطقی مشخص بشه."
        },
        "intent": "summarize_complex_decision",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c2_complex_decision_matrix_criterion",
          "c2_complex_decision_matrix_sensitivity",
          "c2_complex_decision_matrix_scenario"
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "questions",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "grammar_point",
      "external_id": "g_c2_complex_decision_matrix_mixed_conditionals",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-complex-decision-matrix-01",
        "slug": "c2-complex-decision-matrix-mixed-conditionals",
        "title": "Mixed conditionals",
        "rule_summary": "Combine different time references when a past condition has a present result or a present state explains a past outcome.",
        "explanation": {
          "fa": "وقتی شرط و نتیجه به زمان‌های متفاوت مربوط‌اند از mixed conditional استفاده می‌کنیم."
        },
        "examples": [
          {
            "en": "If we had invested earlier, we would be in a stronger position now.",
            "fa": "اگر زودتر سرمایه‌گذاری کرده بودیم، الان موقعیت قوی‌تری داشتیم."
          },
          {
            "en": "If she were less cautious, she might have accepted the offer.",
            "fa": "اگر این‌قدر محتاط نبود، شاید پیشنهاد را قبول کرده بود."
          }
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "grammar_point",
      "external_id": "g_c2_complex_decision_matrix_nominalisation",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-complex-decision-matrix-02",
        "slug": "c2-complex-decision-matrix-nominalisation",
        "title": "Nominalisation in formal discourse",
        "rule_summary": "Turn verbs or adjectives into noun phrases to make formal arguments more compact and abstract when appropriate.",
        "explanation": {
          "fa": "در گفتار و نوشتار رسمی، در صورت مناسب بودن فعل یا صفت را به عبارت اسمی تبدیل می‌کنیم تا استدلال فشرده‌تر و انتزاعی‌تر شود."
        },
        "examples": [
          {
            "en": "The rapid expansion of the service created new risks.",
            "fa": "گسترش سریع سرویس ریسک‌های جدیدی ایجاد کرد."
          },
          {
            "en": "A reduction in waiting times would benefit everyone.",
            "fa": "کاهش زمان انتظار به نفع همه خواهد بود."
          }
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "grammar_point",
      "external_id": "g_c2_complex_decision_matrix_discourse_management",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-complex-decision-matrix-03",
        "slug": "c2-complex-decision-matrix-discourse-management",
        "title": "Managing complex discourse",
        "rule_summary": "Use signposting and metadiscourse to frame, sequence, return to, and close complex points without losing the listener.",
        "explanation": {
          "fa": "با signposting و metadiscourse نکات پیچیده را قاب‌بندی، مرتب، دوباره جمع و نتیجه‌گیری می‌کنیم تا شنونده مسیر بحث را گم نکند."
        },
        "examples": [
          {
            "en": "Before I come back to that point, let me clarify one assumption.",
            "fa": "قبل از اینکه به آن نکته برگردم، بگذار یک فرض را روشن کنم."
          },
          {
            "en": "That brings us to the broader question of accountability.",
            "fa": "این ما را به پرسش گسترده‌تر پاسخ‌گویی می‌رساند."
          }
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "external_id": "d_c2_complex_decision_matrix_scene_1",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-complex-decision-matrix-01",
        "title": "Complex Decisions, Competing Criteria & Robust Choice: part 1",
        "setting": "seminar break",
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "questions",
        "characters": [
          "Ivy",
          "David"
        ],
        "turns": [
          {
            "order": 1,
            "speaker": "Ivy",
            "text": "Which assumption is doing most of the work here?",
            "translation_fa": "کدوم فرض بیشترین نقش رو در این استدلال داره؟"
          },
          {
            "order": 2,
